{"3999150": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "HyperDissonance", "steam_appid": 3999150, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Enter the year of 2057 and play this unique <strong>psychological horror experience</strong> set in a cyberpunk city run by tyrannical corporations in the process of scraping the last pieces of humanity from society. You will need to <strong>hack</strong> into devices through a <strong>Linux terminal</strong> to gather hidden information and uncover the truth.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999150/extras/0f0278443bd4a2d0ab42318a1d5d8d37.poster.avif?t=1781944581\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999150/extras/0f0278443bd4a2d0ab42318a1d5d8d37.webm?t=1781944581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999150/extras/0f0278443bd4a2d0ab42318a1d5d8d37.mp4?t=1781944581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Faith, a young aspiring hacker</i></strong><i> one day wakes up to her father and all the memories of the last month of her life being gone. She enters a mysterious <strong>Apartment</strong> and slowly falls into a rabbit hole of memory-altering state-of-the-art <strong>Bio-Chip technology</strong>. <strong>Hack</strong> your way through <strong>The</strong> <strong>Apartment</strong> and try to piece together what really happened to Faith and her Father.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999150/extras/8bf6707833fdc311b715bf9ffdf64fb7.poster.avif?t=1781944581\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999150/extras/8bf6707833fdc311b715bf9ffdf64fb7.webm?t=1781944581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999150/extras/8bf6707833fdc311b715bf9ffdf64fb7.mp4?t=1781944581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>FEATURES</u></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Linux-inspired terminal</strong> - Hack everything around you and extract data in style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique mash-up of PS1 and cyberpunk aesthetics</strong> - Never seen before combination of retro-styled PS1 environments and sci-fi futuristic elements!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full in tense fear and terror</strong> - Creepy apartments, scary, gory imagery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two unique endings</strong> - Find the secret ending and uncover the mystery.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >NOTICE:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The assets, gifs and artworks you see on this game's page show in-development look at the game. Nothing is final and is subject to change.</i></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Enter the year of 2057 and play this unique <strong>psychological horror experience</strong> set in a cyberpunk city run by tyrannical corporations in the process of scraping the last pieces of humanity from society. You will need to <strong>hack</strong> into devices through a <strong>Linux terminal</strong> to gather hidden information and uncover the truth.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999150/extras/0f0278443bd4a2d0ab42318a1d5d8d37.poster.avif?t=1781944581\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999150/extras/0f0278443bd4a2d0ab42318a1d5d8d37.webm?t=1781944581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999150/extras/0f0278443bd4a2d0ab42318a1d5d8d37.mp4?t=1781944581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Faith, a young aspiring hacker</i></strong><i> one day wakes up to her father and all the memories of the last month of her life being gone. She enters a mysterious <strong>Apartment</strong> and slowly falls into a rabbit hole of memory-altering state-of-the-art <strong>Bio-Chip technology</strong>. <strong>Hack</strong> your way through <strong>The</strong> <strong>Apartment</strong> and try to piece together what really happened to Faith and her Father.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999150/extras/8bf6707833fdc311b715bf9ffdf64fb7.poster.avif?t=1781944581\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999150/extras/8bf6707833fdc311b715bf9ffdf64fb7.webm?t=1781944581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999150/extras/8bf6707833fdc311b715bf9ffdf64fb7.mp4?t=1781944581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>FEATURES</u></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Linux-inspired terminal</strong> - Hack everything around you and extract data in style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique mash-up of PS1 and cyberpunk aesthetics</strong> - Never seen before combination of retro-styled PS1 environments and sci-fi futuristic elements!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong